ovides healing, Evelyn protects town/school and seeks Gentleman Cavalier; farm Delvers' tower rebuilt. Final props include **Evelyn Blackwood–Lord Ethan Renald/Renault Travail WEDDING INVITATION, SIGNED GCT** (no ceremony enacted) and **UNOPENED red kingdom letter** (no details). **CLOSES SEASON THREE, THIRD STORY ARC AND ENTIRE DELVERS CAMPAIGN (owner-confirmed). DO NOT POINT TO S3E13.** Remaining work: listening, proper-name/romantic implication, exact rescue list and GM-rule check; bonus episodes separately indexed. [Closing narrative](narrative/SEASON_THREE.md) · [three-organ disposition](world/items/three-urns-triangle-gate.md).

