ims Krandal beloved**, says snake staff and armor gifts, brother died on missing Snake Island trip; Krandal fragment memory snake in bed, relationship unknown, don't backfill invented full two-week events. **CASSIUS WISDOM-SAVE MAGICAL GUEST SPEECH** compelling smiles; not proved same spell as later Drone. Public silver heroes presented, ordinal rank pending. Possessing **Khalazar VOICE** shifts maestro→server→Selenar→Giga Shark/cook; **WITHERS TELLS possessed Selenar “I hired the Broscales; I opened the doors,”** highly suspicious NPC utterance with unclear scope; Cassius catches collapsing Selenar. **DRONE physically SOUNDS/ERUPTS from under BALLROOM**, huge floor+glass break, elf/half-elf crowds compulsively march to roper-guarded pit, others carried down, gricks/darkmantles/hook horrors emerge. **Lady Vestal gives Evelyn unidentified ~6-inch curved heart-shaped diamond-tipped HANDLE**, not identified. **Wildfire GRABS Withers in auction room, floor ruptures and both FALL BELOW**, no death/survival shown. Koh nonlethal psychic attacks/defends Anthela (still lucid by link), actually saves Mack/Church; Krandal helps Zoltar. Evelyn+Traveler save guests/schoolgirls escape via broken glass. Krandal **Create Water into hole FAILS (drains)**, Koh **Carrie fireball bracelet explodes but DOES NOT cave in rock**, others pile **~25 ballroom tables over hole** and impede access. **DRONE STILL ACTIVE and entranced elves STILL TRY TO ENTER/EXCAVATE at episode's real cutoff**; no guild campaign approved/launched *in played episode*, no resolved Withers/Wildfire fate. **Future S3 plans** GM mentions **3 IN-WORLD MONTHS** bureaucratic delay; no future events established, Wastes return future production talk only. **Next inventoried Delvers S3E01 — Maximize The Yield** (archive provides source; **unresearched**); no new arc boundary beyond confirmed end of SECOND arc inferred without research.
