AWAKE**, first Rianu Keeves previous morning, same morning as Anthela rescue (NPC report, not directly verified). Silver exam board **Numalari** with Giga Shark, Zoltar, Warden, Min Maximus, Hoffle imp. **Krandal B Power / S Presence / C Purpose, new name “Splenderbelt the Efficient”**; **Evelyn S/S/A, “Grinkeeper the Defender”**; **Koh S/A/A, “One Shot”**. **Exact ordinal Silver rank pending academy**, knighthood titles given; old diviner Min Maximus says he assembled the party by divination, vague “situation two” prophecy **not yet event**. **All three actually pose Bellows Box guild promotional portrait with dragon skull** which is staged for **Bronze Ball fundraising auction, not sold**; party still getting ready at **actual episode cutoff**. **Next bounded Delvers S2E12 — The Bell of The Ball**, verified [inventory](SOURCE_INVENTORY.md), **Season Two finale**, not researched.
**S2E10 — Carrie On researched (ASR-provisional):** [dossier](episodes/S2E10.md) · [exact P/Q8 comparison](../reports/DELVERS_S2E10_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md) **1,269 / 17,985 = 7.06% textual disagreement (NOT WER)**. Both complete exports at matching pinned clean `main` `f79b869d9a41a13e96ceeb5907a0c09bdd5fc92f`, P reviewed through **02:19:40.070**, Q parsed completely and high-risk excerpts independently checked, no original audio. Host says **July 10 2021**, guest rescheduled, **level-up** Koh Evasion, Evelyn Aura of Devotion, Krandal new cleric magic. Direct continuation **after Broscale dinner**, Aegis carries party to guild for **Carrie's ACTUAL completed lecture**; **silver analyst due next evening**, **Bronze Ball two days later, neither occurs**. Carrie translates ancient **Khalazar/Dolbluth split and Underdark defensive dungeons, Dawnless Dunes, Black Basilica** (ancient history still interpretive), identifies **stone music box as Hereditary Drone** that subverts auditory-to-motor brain pathways particularly in elves; unknown **Fulnomic device** merely suspected related. Withers **dug straight into Underdark**, deep mission funding contingent on ball. **Evelyn actually takes black head-mirror**; the broken staff, bell trousers, box, vials, ancient text/book **remain guild**. Guild asks **Krandal to prepare and cast Remove Curse inside unconscious Anthela's dream**, Koh carries **three other minds Anthela/Krandal/Evelyn**, **Carrie wanted to go but is explicitly EXCLUDED by cap**, despite all wrists tied by Evelyn's pink ribbon. Party imitates guards (Keeves present), Evelyn plays **Queen of Birds**, then **Krandal ACTUALLY touches Anthela with Remove Curse and restores memory**. Dream wedding chamber/seen underground city of glowing green crystal disintegrates into black sand; **Khalazar ACTUALLY APPEARS IN DREAM**, first porcelain pale elf carried by bat, then monstrous swirled black-sand/undead form. Party fights; Koh psychic dagger hits, Evelyn lightning javelins, Sanctuary on Anthela, wind fan and Branding Smite; **Khalazar stuns others**, Evelyn resists and later **warhammer critical smashes red crystals in his chest**. Koh **Dimension Doors Anthela to light shaft**, **wife ASCENDS alone** and Koh stays to help others; he **forms force barrier against sand wave (does NOT manually break link)**. **Evelyn picks up red shard from apparent Khalazar body**, party exits dream and **Anthela PHYSICALLY AWAKENS and embraces Koh** in Carrie's laboratory **after ~three months**. **Evelyn ACTUALLY HANDS RED SHARD TO CARRIE**, who had stayed outside dream; final ominous mental warning implies Khalazar **not conclusively dead**. No other elf cured, no Bronze Ball/promotion yet. **Next Delvers S2E11 — New High Score**, available in [inventory](SOURCE_INVENTORY.md), **unresearched**. Audio/map review needed for Khalazar titles, Dolbluth phonetics, Hereditary Drone, guardian/cage/city visual details, harm spell and red shard transfer.
